  <History Date="15-02-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added RDM ID's (note no personality ID's - Standard and RGBW modes will likely fail as they share the same channel count)" Version="4" />
  <History Date="15-02-20" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Standard and Shape + RGB/+RGBW modes.  It is not clear if these are valid or if the two parts are addressed separately however it will likely be better to patch separately regardless.  These are not currently supported in the integrated Capture Visualiser." Version="5" />
